        "F3"
      ],
      "plan": "Present a hypothetical VRAM planning framework for a 12GB GPU, detailing the separation of model weights, KV cache, and other runtime allocations. Emphasize the hypothetical nature and absence of empirical testing. Solicit community input on their VRAM allocation strategies."
    }
  ]
